                        <support>paper and parchment <p>The outer and inner bifolia of quires are
                              made of parchment, and the remaining bifolia are made of paper. In No.
                              1, the inner parchment bifolia are much smaller than the paper
                              bifolia.</p></support>
                        <extent>ff. 171<dimensions type="leaf" unit="mm">
